: \nL173:   * 【9†Search in PubMed】\nL174:   * 【10†Search in NLM Catalog†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL175:   * 【3†Add to Search】\nL176: \nL177: . 2013 Mar 22;339(6126):1412-5.\nL178: \nL179: doi: 10.1126/science.1232252.\nL180: \nL181: # DNA gridiron nanostructures based on four-arm junctions\nL182: \nL183: 【11†Dongran Han】^{  【12†1】 }, 【13†Suchetan Pal】, 【14†Yang Yang】, 【15†Shuoxing Jiang】, 【16†Jeanette Nangreave】, 【17†Yan Liu】, 【18†Hao Yan】\nL184: \nL185: Affiliations Expand\nL186: ### Affiliation\nL187: \nL188:   * ^{1} The Biodesign Institute, Arizona State University, Tempe, AZ 85287, USA. dongran.han@asu.edu\nL189: \nL190:   * PMID: 23520107\nL191:   * DOI: 【19†10.1126/science.1232252†doi.org】\nL192: \nL193: Item in Clipboard\nL194: # DNA gridiron nanostructures based on four-arm junctions\nL195: \nL196: Dongran Han et al. Science. 2013.\nL197: \nL198: Show details\nL199: \nL200: Display options\nL201: \nL202: Display options\nL203: \nL204: Format [Select]\nL205: \nL206: [Button: Science ]\nL207: \nL208: Actions\nL209: \nL210:   * 【9†Search in PubMed】\nL211:   * 【10†Search in NLM Catalog†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL212:   * 【3†Add to Search】\nL213: \nL214: . 2013 Mar 22;339(6126):1412-5.\nL215: \nL216: doi: 10.1126/science.1232252.\nL217: \nL218: ### Authors\nL219: \nL220: 【11†Dongran Han】^{  【20†1】 }, 【13†Suchetan Pal】, 【14†Yang Yang】, 【15†Shuoxing Jiang】, 【16†Jeanette Nangreave】, 【17†Yan Liu】, 【18†Hao Yan】\nL221: ### Affiliation\nL222: \nL223:   * ^{1} The Biodesign Institute, Arizona State University, Tempe, AZ 85287, USA. dongran.han@asu.edu\nL224: \nL225:   * PMID: 23520107\nL226:   * DOI: 【19†10.1126/science.1232252†doi.org】\nL227: \nL228: Item in Clipboard\nL229: \nL230: [Button: Full text links ]Cite\nL231: \nL232: Display options\nL233: \nL234: Display options\nL235: \nL236: Format [Select]\nL237: \nL238: Linked Discoveries\nL239: ## Abstract\nL240: Engineering wireframe architectures and scaffolds of increasing complexity is one of the important challenges in nanotechnology. We present a design strategy to create gridiron-like DNA structures. A series of four-arm junctions are used as vertices within a network of double-helical DNA fragments. Deliberate distortion of the junctions from their most relaxed conformations ensures that a scaffold strand can traverse through individual vertices in multiple directions.\nL241: DNA gridirons were assembled, ranging from two-dimensional arrays with reconfigurability to multilayer and three-dimensional structures and curved objects.\nL242: 【21†PubMed Disclaimer】\nL243: ## Publication types\nL244: \nL245:   * [Button: Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't ]\nL246: \nL247: Actions\nL248: \nL249:     * 【22†Search in PubMed】\nL250:     * 【23†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL251:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL252: \nL253:   * [Button: Research Support, U.S. Gov't, Non-P.H.S. ]\nL254: \nL255: Actions\nL256: \nL257:     * 【24†Search in PubMed】\nL258:     * 【25†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL259:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL260: ## MeSH terms\nL261: \nL262:   * [Button: DNA / chemistry* ]\nL263: \nL264: Actions\nL265: \nL266:     * 【26†Search in PubMed】\nL267:     * 【27†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL268:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL269: \nL270:   * [Button: DNA / ultrastructure* ]\nL271: \nL272: Actions\nL273: \nL274:     * 【28†Search in PubMed】\nL275:     * 【27†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL276:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL277: \nL278:   * [Button: Models, Molecular ]\nL279: \nL280: Actions\nL281: \nL282:     * 【29†Search in PubMed】\nL283:     * 【30†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL284:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL285: \nL286:   * [Button: Nanostructures* ]\nL287: \nL288: Actions\nL289:     * 【31†Search in PubMed】\nL290:     * 【32†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL291:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL292: \nL293:   * [Button: Nanotechnology / methods ]\nL294: \nL295: Actions\nL296: \nL297:     * 【33†Search in PubMed】\nL298:     * 【34†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov